  "title": "Blueberry Summer Squash Bread",
  "description": "This blueberry summer squash bread recipe pairs summer squash with fresh blueberries and blueberry syrup for a fruity tweak on regular zucchini bread.",
  "authors": [
    "HannahRose"
  ],
